<p class="eyebrow">FORM EXAMPLE</p><h1>A small form.<br><span>A complete request.</span></h1><p class="lede">Try a POST route with validation, escaped output, and a signed CSRF token. This preview displays your submission locally.</p><div class="form-grid"><form class="card" method="post" action="<?= $e($route('contact.submit')) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="<?= $e($csrf) ?>"><?php foreach(['name'=>'Your name','email'=>'Email address'] as $field=>$label): ?><label for="<?= $e($field) ?>"><?= $e($label) ?></label><input id="<?= $e($field) ?>" name="<?= $e($field) ?>" type="<?= $field==='email'?'email':'text' ?>" required maxlength="<?= $field==='email'?254:80 ?>" value="<?= $e($values[$field] ?? '') ?>"><?php if(isset($errors[$field])): ?><p class="error"><?= $e($errors[$field]) ?></p><?php endif; ?><?php endforeach; ?><label for="message">Message</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" maxlength="1000" required><?= $e($values['message'] ?? '') ?></textarea><?php if(isset($errors['message'])): ?><p class="error"><?= $e($errors['message']) ?></p><?php endif; ?><button class="button primary" type="submit">Preview submission ↗</button></form><section class="card form-explanation"><?php if($submitted): ?><span class="tag">VALIDATED</span><h2>Thanks, <?= $e($values['name']) ?>.</h2><p><?= $e($values['message']) ?></p><p class="muted">The controller validated this request and rendered the response. Add your own action or repository to persist it.</p><?php else: ?><span class="number">HOW IT WORKS</span><h2>From form to controller.</h2><ol><li>The browser sends a POST request.</li><li>Middleware verifies the form token.</li><li>The controller validates each field.</li><li>The view renders the result.</li></ol><code>HomeController::submit()</code><?php endif; ?></section></div>
